ource_paragraph_tongjian_id":"f6c61206-cb80-544b-9473-a8a5a0051f72","source_start_index":29,"source_text":"秦昭王三十二年，穰侯攻魏，至大梁。"},{"context_after":"汉初，曹参西至开封，击秦赵贲军，破之，围贲开封城中。又沛...","context_before":"开封废县[在府南五十里。魏邑也。","source_end_index":45,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"591115a4-14f9-532f-afd7-64e0b0d24c2b","source_start_index":16,"source_text":"《史记》：韩釐王二十一年，使暴鸢救魏，为秦所败，鸢走开封。"},{"context_after":"《竹书纪年》：晋出公六年，齐、郑伐卫，荀瑶城宅阳。又惠王...","context_before":"...年，与韩王会于宅阳。《史记》：赵、魏合攻秦，不利于宅阳。","source_end_index":63,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"db3ea6b9-15ae-523c-8c6c-6eca8e6a6f01","source_start_index":44,"source_text":"又魏冉走魏将芒卯，入于北宅，即宅阳也。"}],"path":"河南方舆纪要/一、开封府（卷四十七）","source_name":"读史方舆纪要"}],"class_tags":[],"content":"1秦相國穰侯伐魏。韓暴鳶救魏，穰侯大破之，斬首四萬。暴鳶走開封。魏納八城以和。穰侯復伐魏，走芒卯，入北宅。魏人割溫以和。","content_fanyi":"秦国相国穰侯魏冉攻打魏国。韩国暴鸢率军救魏，穰侯魏冉大败暴鸢，斩首四万人。暴鸢逃奔开封。魏国向秦国割让八座城邑求和。穰侯再次攻打魏国，迫使魏相芒卯逃走，攻入北宅，并围攻大梁。魏国人割让温县求和。","content_jianti_auto":"1秦相国穰侯伐魏。韩暴鸢救魏，穰侯大破之，斩首四万。暴鸢走开封。魏纳八城以和。穰侯复伐魏，走芒卯，入北宅。魏人割温以和。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":376,"number":1,"path":"资治通鉴 : 卷第四 (周紀四) / 赧王中 / 四十年 / 第 1 段","reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"8cc00ab6-db0e-11ef-95f0-a0d3651f611f","year_int":-275},"tongjian_id":"8cc00ab6-db0e-11ef-95f0-a0d3651f611f"},"paragraph_order":2},{"mention_count":1,"paragraph_brief":{"brief_for":"芒卯","paragraph":{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"司馬彪","people_name_jianti_auto":"司马彪","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"8cc00b00-db0e-11ef-9ddb-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"史伯","people_name_jianti_auto":"史伯","start_index":55,"tongjian_id":"8cc00b01-db0e-11ef-8440-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"鄭桓公","people_name_jianti_auto":"郑桓公","start_index":58,"tongjian_id":"8cc00b02-db0e-11ef-9009-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"韋昭","peo